+
+animation_workspace_ms <value>
+	Duration of the workspace switch animation. 0 (the default) uses
+	*animation_duration_ms*.
+
+*animation_workspace_style* slide|fade|both
+	How a workspace switch is drawn. *slide* (the default) translates the
+	outgoing and incoming workspaces horizontally, entering from the side the
+	new workspace's number lies on. *fade* crossfades them in place. *both*
+	slides and crossfades together. Workspaces whose names do not begin with a
+	number are treated as lying to the right of numbered ones.
 
 *assign* <criteria> [→] [workspace] [number] <workspace>
